---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Activities
description: Free colouring pages and printable Character Passports starring the whole crew.
permalink: /activities/
extraStyles: |
  .page-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr)); gap:24px; }
  .colour-card, .passport-card{ background:#fff; border-radius:var(--radius); padding:18px; box-shadow:var(--shadow-card); display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; }
  .colour-card .thumb{ border-radius:12px; aspect-ratio:3/4; overflow:hidden; background:#fff; border:1px solid #eee; }
  .colour-card .thumb img{ width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain; display:block; }
  .colour-card h3{ font-size:1.02rem; color:var(--teal-dark); }
  .passport-card .thumb{ border-radius:12px; aspect-ratio:1/1; overflow:hidden; }
  .passport-card .fields{ font-size:.85rem; color:#555; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; }
  .passport-card .fields b{ color:var(--teal-dark); }
  .btn.download{ text-align:center; }
---
{% from "partials/art.njk" import character as characterArt %}

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Activities</span>
    <h1>Grab your crayons</h1>
    <p>Free colouring pages and printable Character Passports — every download is a real page from Koa's world, ready for the fridge door.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="wrap" id="colouring" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="section-head reveal in">
    <span class="eyebrow">Free Colouring Pages</span>
    <h2>Ten pages, the whole crew</h2>
    <p>Every page prints on a single A4 sheet. Download, print, colour — done.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-grid" style="margin-top:32px;">
    {% set colouring = [
      ["koa-cleans-the-beach", "Koa Cleans the Beach"],
      ["koa-goes-surfing", "Koa Goes Surfing"],
      ["gully-by-the-sea", "Gully by the Sea"],
      ["dune-the-explorer", "Dune the Explorer"],
      ["mokus-surf-check", "Moku's Surf Check"],
      ["boko-and-guss-mangroves", "Boko & Guss in the Mangroves"],
      ["friends-at-byron-bay", "Friends at Byron Bay"],
      ["koa-at-the-lighthouse", "Koa at the Lighthouse"],
      ["paddleboarding-with-moku", "Paddleboarding with Moku"],
      ["beach-day-kombi", "Beach Day with the Kombi"]
    ] %}
    {% for p in colouring %}
    <div class="colour-card reveal in">
      <div class="thumb"><img src="/assets/printables/previews/{{ p[0] }}.webp" alt="{{ p[1] }} colouring page preview" loading="lazy"></div>
      <h3>{{ p[1] }}</h3>
      <a class="btn small download" href="/assets/printables/colouring/{{ p[0] }}.pdf" download>Download Colouring Page (PDF)</a>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="passports">
  <div class="section-head reveal in">
    <span class="eyebrow">Collect Them All</span>
    <h2>Character Passports</h2>
    <p>A printable passport for every friend — with their home, their favourites, a space for your name, and a stamp box for when you've met them in the books.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-grid" style="margin-top:32px;">
    {% for c in characters %}{% if c.status == "live" %}
    <div class="passport-card reveal in" id="passport-{{ c.slug }}">
      <div class="thumb">{{ characterArt(c, 200) }}</div>
      <h3 style="color:var(--teal-dark);">{{ c.name }}</h3>
      <div class="fields">
        <span><b>Species:</b> {{ c.species }}</span>
        <span><b>Home:</b> {{ c.home }}</span>
      </div>
      <a class="btn small download" href="/assets/printables/passports/{{ c.slug }}.pdf" download>Download Passport (PDF)</a>
    </div>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="did-you-know" style="padding-bottom:80px;">
  <div class="dyk reveal in" style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="badge-icon">{% shell %}</div>
    <div>
      <h3>Did you know?</h3>
      <p>Goannas like Dune can climb trees, sprint on two legs, and smell food from far away with their forked tongues — real Byron Bay locals!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
